# State political pie chart for Legacy of Kattail.
# Technique adapted from Yard1/HoI4-Scripted-GUI-Pie-Chart. Credit: Yard1.
#
# 50 slices are used instead of Yard1's 100 because this GUI is instantiated
# for the selected state. This keeps the chart lightweight while preserving
# a visually smooth chart. Exact normalized values are shown in the hover tooltip.

